4. SSE connects to that run's stream
5. Panel shows real-time status updates and step progress
6. User clicks Console button to open modal with live output (polling every 2s)

**Key behavior:** Both pages connect to the same SSE endpoint (`/api/pipeline-runs/{runId}/stream`), so both receive the same events in real-time.

